  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and what of that? I am a man and I have my affairs,\"",
  "[action] (to the second son) eldest son and second son argue",
  "[action] Wang Lung sits and smokes pipe",
  "[says] Wang Lung asks his sons to tell him about the harvest.",
  "Wang Lung: \"Well now, tell me about the harvest, my sons. How much grain did you plant and how much has come in? And how is the land?\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung listens",
  "[says] Wang Lung expresses pleasure about the harvest.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Well, and it is a good harvest and I am glad of it.\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung sits on bench",
  "[action] The second son stands and looks at his father.",
  "the second son (to the eldest son): \"Well, and you are my father, and I will stay with you, and I have no need to go.\"",
  "[action] The second son looks at his father and waits for a response.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Yes, and my wife is my father's daughter, and she is a good woman and will make a good wife for you, and she will do her duty to you.\"",
  "[silence] the second son says nothing.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"I will stay with my father,\"",
